+ * test is env->x87_rn53, set where the control word's precision and rounding are set (update_fp_status); and the
+ * library comes in two flavours from this one source.  The fast one (the default build) has no check or stats code.
+ * The check flavour (built with -DUC_X87_CHECK_BUILD, its own library) adds UC_X87_CHECK=1, which runs softfloat beside
+ * every fast result and counts any difference (a line on stderr at exit), and UC_X87_STATS=1. */
